guide forever/horde/02-barrens
title The Barrens
faction Horde
levels 10-19
zone The Barrens
next forever/horde/03-hillsbrad
pitch The Horde's crossroads: one long savanna loop from the Crossroads to Ratchet and the Dry Hills, open to every Horde race.
pro The road every Horde race shares
pro Wind riders to trainers
pro Skyborne: 22 min faster to level 32
con From Tirisfal: zeppelins there and back
con Undead: 2 min slower to level 32

# Built from the simulator's consensus Horde route
# (world 5b662c40: the Barrens visit's 16-20 package, every quest of it in the
# simulator's order). Not yet play-tested on Forever. The consensus then stays
# in the Barrens for its 21-25 package (forever/horde/04-barrens) after a grind
# at 19-23; this route spends those levels in Tarren Mill instead
# (forever/horde/03-hillsbrad, cost measured there).
#
# Arrivals, all at the Crossroads (simulator levels): Orcs and Trolls at about
# 10.5 from Orgrimmar, with the Crossroads flight path; Tauren at 10 from
# Thunder Bluff, after a grind at the Crossroads; Undead at 11.7 from Brill by
# the zeppelin, through Orgrimmar's own quests (the block below, to 12.1);
# Skyborne at 14.6 from the airship landing in northern Mulgore. Undead and
# Skyborne choose between this guide (the default and the consensus route for
# both) and forever/horde/02-silverpine.
#
# Flow: Crossroads (bind) -> Razormane camp east -> Crossroads -> Regthar and
# Barak Kodobane -> Razormane camp again -> Crossroads (Mankrik, 14) -> Verog at
# the Stagnant Oasis -> Bristleback camps and Mankrik's wife -> Northwatch Hold
# escort -> Ratchet (Bruuz, raptor horns) -> Crossroads (training trip) -> the
# Wailing Caverns mound -> Regthar, Hezrul -> Makaba at the Stonetalon edge ->
# the Dry Hills (Walton, Vrang, harpies) -> the Sludge Fen and the Venture Co.
# research site -> hearth -> Northwatch guns and the Southsea beach -> Ratchet
# -> Orgrimmar (training) -> the zeppelin to the Undercity.
#
# Deviations from the consensus (measured with the simulator):
# - The consensus grinds 11-15 (2.7 h). This guide fills that time with
#   Barrens quests that together beat the grind (each measured alone, hours
#   at the end of 07-thousand-needles, Orc): Centaur
#   Bracers (-0.05 h), Samophlange (+0.03 h), Disrupt the Attacks / The
#   Disruption Ends / Supplies for the Crossroads (+0.05 h), Raptor Thieves /
#   Stolen Silver (+0.05 h), Harpy Raiders and Southsea Freebooters / The
#   Missing Shipment (taken on the way). The whole guide against the
#   consensus skeleton, hours at the end of 03-hillsbrad: -0.35 h (Orc),
#   -0.31 h (Tauren), 19 more quests.
# - Level 16 training: one trip to Orgrimmar / Thunder Bluff on the
#   wind-rider quests (Meats to Orgrimmar, A Bundle of Hides).
#
# Left out:
# - Deepmoss Spider Eggs (1069): the consensus takes it and never finishes it.
# - Chen's Empty Keg (819, 821): +0.45 h; Harpy Lieutenants (875): +0.2 h.
# - The Forgotten Pools / Plainstrider Menace chains (870, 844) and the
#   breadcrumbs into them: the grind and the quests above fill those levels.
# - The rogue's Tazan logbook (1858): it sends you back to the beach after
#   Orgrimmar; Wailing Caverns quests other than the outside-cave ones.
# - Hidden Enemies (5726, Thrall, for Undead in Orgrimmar): Ragefire Chasm.
#
# Optional: Trouble at the Docks (959) and Smart Drinks (1491). Mad Magglish
# and the Devouring Ectoplasms are elite: grouping up is advised.
# Stolen Silver (3281) is taken on the Crossroads visit at 14: it is a level
# 18 quest, too far above a Tauren arriving at 10.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Undead: Orgrimmar

step Zeppelin to Orgrimmar
  only Undead
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip From Brill, walk east to the zeppelin towers outside the Ruins of Lordaeron and take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar (the other one goes to Grom'gol).
  goto 60.7,58.9 "Zeppelin tower"

step Valley of Strength
  only Undead
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip The zeppelin lands just north-east of Orgrimmar's main gate. Doras stands on the tower in the Valley of Strength; Thatog and Borstan are a few steps north.
  getfp "Orgrimmar" npc 3310          -- Doras, the wind rider master
  accept 97246                        -- Thatog
  turnin 97246                        -- Borstan's Firepit
  accept 97249

step The Drag
  only Undead
  tip Kor'geld and Yelmak run the alchemy shop in the Drag; Whuut is next door.
  accept 97242                        -- Kor'geld
  accept 97275                        -- Yelmak
  turnin 97275                        -- Whuut

step Valley of Honor
  only Undead
  tip The cattails and speargrass grow along the water flows in the Valley of Honor, east of the Drag.
  collect 277278 quest 97242.1
  collect 277279 quest 97242.2

step Kor'geld
  only Undead
  turnin 97242

step Grommash Hold
  only Undead
  tip Thra and Migi sit behind Grommash Hold in the Valley of Wisdom; the Smooth Boulders lie around them. Thrall is inside the hold.
  accept 97326                        -- Thra
  collect 277952 quest 97326.1
  turnin 97326
  turnin 97249                        -- Migi

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Skyborne: Mulgore

step To the Crossroads
  only Skyborne
  zone The Barrens
  tip From the airship landing in northern Mulgore, follow the Gold Road north-east out of Mulgore into the Barrens and on to the Crossroads.
  goto 51.5,30.0 "The Crossroads"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Crossroads

step The Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  tip The Crossroads is your base for the first half of the zone. From Orgrimmar, leave by the main gate and follow the road west across the Southfury River.
  getfp "Crossroads" npc 3615         -- Devrak, the wind rider master
  sethome "The Crossroads" npc 3934   -- Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind
  accept 871                          -- Thork
  accept 5041
  accept 869                          -- Gazrog

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Razormane camp

step Razormane camp
  tip Water Seekers, Thornweavers and Hunters hold the camp east of town. The supply crates sit at its eastern end. Kill every Sunscale raptor you pass for heads; they roam all the plains around the Crossroads.
  goto 55.0,26.0 "Razormane camp"
  kill 3267 quest 871.1
  kill 3268 quest 871.2
  kill 3265 quest 871.3
  collect 12708 quest 5041.1 @58.8,25.8
  collect 5062 quest 869.1

step Kranal Fiss
  only Shaman
  tip Kranal Fiss stands on the ridge north of the Razormane camp.
  turnin 2983 only Orc,Troll
  turnin 1523 only Tauren
  accept 1524

step Far Watch Post
  only Warrior
  tip Follow the road east to the outpost above the Southfury River.
  turnin 1505 only Orc,Troll,Tauren   -- Uzzek
  accept 1498

step Telf Joolam
  only Shaman
  zone Durotar
  tip Telf waits on the riverbank south-east of Far Watch Post, across the bridge.
  turnin 1524
  accept 1525

step Thunder lizards across the river
  only Warrior
  zone Durotar
  tip Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides graze just across the bridge below Far Watch Post.
  collect 6486 quest 1498.1

step Dustwind Gulch cultists
  only Shaman
  zone Durotar
  tip Burning Blade Cultists hold Dustwind Gulch in northern Durotar. The Fire Tar comes from the Razormane on your next visit to their camp.
  collect 6652 quest 1525.2

step Uzzek
  only Warrior
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 1498
  accept 1502

step The Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 871                          -- Thork
  turnin 5041
  accept 872
  turnin 869                          -- Gazrog

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Regthar and Barak

step Regthar Deathgate
  tip Regthar stands at the Kolkar watch post just west of the Crossroads.
  accept 850
  accept 855

step Barak Kodobane
  tip Barak stands in the Kolkar camp north-west of Regthar. Every Kolkar you kill from now on can drop Centaur Bracers.
  goto 42.8,23.5 "Barak's camp"
  collect 5022 quest 850.1
  collect 5030 quest 855.1

step Regthar Deathgate
  turnin 850
  accept 851

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Disruption Ends

step The Disruption Ends
  tip Back to the Razormane camp. Geomancers and Defenders hold its eastern half; Kreenig Snarlsnout walks among them.
  goto 57.5,25.5 "Razormane camp"
  kill 3269 quest 872.1
  kill 3266 quest 872.2
  collect 5063 quest 872.3 @58.5,27.0
  collect 5026 quest 1525.1 only Shaman

step Thun'grim Firegaze
  only Warrior
  tip Thun'grim camps beside the road east toward Ratchet. The Stolen Iron Chest sits in the Razormane camp just north of him.
  turnin 1502
  accept 1503
  collect 6534 quest 1503.1
  turnin 1503

step Telf Joolam
  only Shaman
  zone Durotar
  tip Telf makes Fire Sapta from the tar and pouch. Use it by the brazier next to him to reveal the Minor Manifestation of Fire, kill it for the Glowing Ember, then place the ember in the brazier.
  turnin 1525
  accept 1526
  collect 6655 quest 1526.1
  turnin 1526
  accept 1527

step Kranal Fiss
  only Shaman
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 1527

