# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South: Verog, the Bristlebacks, Northwatch

step Verog the Dervish
  tip Verog walks among the Kolkar at the Stagnant Oasis south-east of the Crossroads. Keep killing Kolkar for bracers.
  goto 53.1,41.7 "The Stagnant Oasis"
  collect 5023 quest 851.1
  collect 5030 quest 855.1

step Bristleback camps
  tip The Bristleback quilboar camp across the plains south of the oasis. Every Bristleback drops a tusk; the Razormane Raiders among them carry Olgra's Adornments. Mankrik's wife lies at the camp's north edge.
  goto 48.0,53.0 "Bristleback camps"
  collect 5085 quest 899.1
  collect 277277 quest 95774.1
  complete 4921 @49.3,50.3

step Free From the Hold
  tip Gilthares Firebough is chained inside Northwatch Hold, south-east along the coast. Talk to him to start the escort and stay close: Theramore soldiers attack on the way out. He walks you to Ratchet.
  accept 898 @62.0,55.0
  complete 898

