# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Level 16 training

step Meats to Orgrimmar
  only Orc,Troll
  tip The Crossroads has no class trainers. Zargh's wind-rider errand takes you to Orgrimmar and back for a little experience.
  accept 6365                         -- Zargh
  turnin 6365                         -- Devrak
  accept 6384
  fly "Orgrimmar"

step Orgrimmar
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  turnin 6384                         -- Innkeeper Gryshka
  accept 6385
  turnin 6385                         -- Doras
  accept 6386
