step Back to the Crossroads
  only Orc,Troll
  zone The Barrens
  fly "Crossroads"
  turnin 6386                         -- Zargh

step A Bundle of Hides
  only Tauren
  tip The Crossroads has no class trainers. Jahan's wind-rider errand takes you to Thunder Bluff and back for a little experience.
  accept 6361                         -- Jahan Hawkwing
  turnin 6361                         -- Devrak
  accept 6362
