step Trial of the Lake
  only Druid
  zone Moonglade
  tip Dive into Lake Elune'ara for a Shrine Bauble, take it to the Shrine of Remulos in the north-west and use it there, then speak with Tajarri.
  complete 28
  turnin 28                           -- Tajarri
  accept 30

step Back to the Crossroads
  only Tauren
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Druids: hearth to the Crossroads from Moonglade, then pick the wind-rider letter up on your next Thunder Bluff visit. Everyone else flies back.
  fly "Crossroads"

