# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Wailing Caverns mound

step Wailing Caverns mound
  tip The mound in Lushwater Oasis, south-west of the Crossroads. Devouring Ectoplasms ooze around the outside; Mad Magglish hides, stealthed, in the outer cave before the instance portal. The Devouring Ectoplasms and Mad Magglish are elite: grouping up is advised.
  goto 46.5,35.0 "Wailing Caverns mound"
  collect 6464 quest 1491.1 optional
  collect 5334 quest 959.1 optional

step Regthar Deathgate
  turnin 851
  accept 852
  collect 5030 quest 855.1            -- Finish the bracers on the Kolkar around Regthar if you are short
  turnin 855

step Hezrul Bloodmark
  tip Hezrul leads the Kolkar on the west shore of Lushwater Oasis.
  collect 5025 quest 852.1 @46.0,41.1

step Regthar Deathgate
  turnin 852

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Stonetalon edge

step Makaba Flathoof
  tip Follow the road west from Regthar toward Stonetalon. Makaba camps where the road climbs out of the Barrens; the Grimtotem are all around her.
  accept 6548 @35.2,27.8
  kill 11910 quest 6548.1
  kill 11911 quest 6548.2
  turnin 6548
  accept 6629

step Grundig Darkcloud
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip Grundig and the Grimtotem Brutes hold the camp up the road, just inside Stonetalon.
  kill 11858 quest 6629.1 @73.7,86.1
  kill 11912 quest 6629.2

step Makaba Flathoof
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 6629

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Dry Hills

step Walton and Vrang
  tip North-east to the Dry Hills. Walton's camp and Vrang Wildgore are a few steps apart below the hills.
  accept 95508 @42.0,11.4             -- Walton
  goto 42.0,11.4 "Walton's camp"      -- Assist Walton: stay by him when Terry Longdrink and the Kul Tiras marines come up the ridge
  turnin 95508
  accept 95621
  accept 95494 @43.8,12.2             -- Vrang Wildgore
  accept 95495
  accept 95507

step The wrecked caravan
  tip Corporal Adamore and his Kul Tiras marines hold the wrecked caravan south of Walton.
  collect 270151 quest 95621.1 @41.8,15.6

step Witchwing harpies
  tip The harpies nest in the hills west of the caravan; any of them drops a talon. Check every Sprung Trap you pass for Vrang's game.
  goto 40.5,17.0 "Witchwing harpies"
  collect 5064 quest 867.1
  collect 269719 quest 95507.1

step Savannah lions
  tip Savannah Patriarchs and Matriarchs roam the plains east of the hills; both drop the hides.
  collect 269715 quest 95494.1
  collect 269719 quest 95507.1

step Druid: Gathering the Cure
  only Druid
  tip Earthroot grows all over the northern plains; Barrens Kodos drop the horns. Then use Tonga's salve on Sickly Gazelles north of the east-west road.
  collect 2449 quest 6128.1
  collect 15852 quest 6128.2

step Walton and Vrang
  turnin 95494                        -- Vrang Wildgore
  turnin 95507
  turnin 95495                        -- Walton
  turnin 95621

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Sludge Fen

step Wizzlecrank's Shredder
  tip East to the Sludge Fen. The shredder stands inside the Venture Co. camp; Supervisor Lugwizzle carries the key.
  accept 858 @56.5,7.4
  collect 5050 quest 858.1 @56.3,8.6
  turnin 858
  accept 863

step The Escape
  tip Wizzlecrank drives his shredder out of the camp: stay with him and kill whatever attacks him. Sputtervalve takes it in Ratchet.
  complete 863

step Control Console
  tip The console is at the Venture Co. research site west of the Sludge Fen. Close the three valves around the drill, use the console again, then take the Console Key from Tinkerer Sniggles.
  turnin 894
  accept 900
  interact 61936 quest 900.1
  interact 61935 quest 900.2
  interact 4072 quest 900.3
  turnin 900
  accept 901
  collect 5089 quest 901.1 @52.8,10.4
  turnin 901
  accept 902

step Boulder Lode Mine
  tip The Venture Co. Overseers and Enforcers at the mine in the north-east corner of the zone drop the Cats Eye Emerald.
  collect 5097 quest 896.1 @61.0,4.2

step Druid: Curing the Sick
  only Druid
  tip Tonga makes the salve; use it on 10 Sickly Gazelles on the plains north of the road.
  turnin 6128                         -- Tonga Runetotem
  accept 6129
  kill 12296 quest 6129.1

