# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To the Undercity

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Fly to Orgrimmar to train, then take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades from the tower outside the west gate.
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  turnin 1963 only Rogue,Orc,Troll    -- Therzok, Cleft of Shadow
  train class

step Druid: Moonglade
  only Druid
  zone Moonglade
  tip Teleport to Moonglade to hand Dendrite the cure, and look for the two Pendant halves while you are there, then hearth. Dendrite's two new quests go to Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff: the next guide starts there for you.
  turnin 6129
  accept 6130
  complete 30
  turnin 30
  accept 31
